WEBVTT

00:04:55.163 --> 00:05:00.463
This decentralized business model
gives financial power back to the creators

00:05:00.463 --> 00:05:03.730
and reduces the power
of the broker, the middleman

00:05:03.763 --> 00:05:06.063
and even social media platforms.

00:05:06.097 --> 00:05:10.830
Amy Rader is a fine artist in Atlanta
who shows in traditional galleries.

00:05:10.863 --> 00:05:12.863
She created her first NFT

00:05:12.863 --> 00:05:15.863
so that she could expand
to an online audience

00:05:15.897 --> 00:05:19.330
and to add a new revenue stream
to increase her income.

00:05:20.197 --> 00:05:21.997
Here's a Greg Mike mural.

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.197
If you're from Atlanta,

00:05:23.197 --> 00:05:27.063
you have probably seen
some of his work on walls and buildings.

00:05:27.063 --> 00:05:28.963
Street art is not permanent,

00:05:28.997 --> 00:05:32.463
so how will an important
cultural icon like Greg Mike